fs picks? Virgil, Gabriel or Pedro Porro for GW1? Or is there any differentials or cheap bargain picks? Hopefully these tips will help you decide which players to go for in your Gameweek 1 team selection squad.\n\n0:00 Intro\n0:55 £4.0m Defenders\n11:28 £4.5m Defenders\n18:17 £5.0m Defenders\n24:03 £5.5m Defenders\n29:35 £6.0m Defenders\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦 https://www.twitter.com/FPLMate\n📸 https://www.instagram.com/FPLMate\n🎶 https://www.tiktok.com/@FPLMate\n🎮 https://www.twitch.tv/fpl_mate\n👾 https://discord.gg/rfVSeftbmx\n🏆 Join: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCweDAlFm2LnVcOqaFU4_AGA/join\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/behupk\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: behupk\n\n#fpl #fantasypremierleague #premierleague"},"lengthSeconds":"2209","ownerProfileUrl":"http://www.youtube.com/@FPLMate","externalChannelId":"UCweDAlFm2LnVcOqaFU4_AGA","isFamilySafe":true,"availableCountries":["AD","AE","AF","AG","AI","AL","AM","AO","AQ","AR","AS","AT","AU","AW","AX","AZ","BA","BB","BD","BE","BF","BG","BH","BI","BJ","BL","BM","BN","BO","BQ","BR","BS","BT","BV","BW","BY","BZ","CA","CC","CD","CF","CG","CH","CI","CK","CL","CM","CN","CO","CR","CU","CV","CW","CX","CY","CZ","DE","DJ","DK","DM","DO","DZ","EC","EE","EG","EH","ER","ES","ET","FI","FJ","FK","FM","FO","FR","GA","GB","GD","GE","GF","GG","GH","GI","GL","GM","GN","GP","GQ","GR","GS","GT","GU","GW","GY","HK","HM","HN","HR","HT","HU","ID","IE","IL","IM","IN","IO","IQ","IR","IS","IT","JE","JM","JO","JP","KE","KG","KH","KI","KM","KN","KP","KR","KW","KY","KZ","LA","LB","LC","LI","LK","LR","LS","LT","LU","LV","LY","MA","MC","MD","ME","MF","MG","MH","MK","ML","MM","MN","MO","MP","MQ","MR","MS","MT","MU","MV","MW","MX","MY","MZ","NA","NC","NE","NF","NG","NI","NL","NO","NP","NR","NU","NZ","OM","PA","PE","PF","PG","PH","PK","PL","PM","PN","PR","PS","PT","PW","PY","QA","RE","RO","RS","RU","RW","SA","SB","SC"