er position, and rank them in order of best to worst. Who are the best defs picks? Virgil, Gabriel or Pedro Porro for GW1? Or is there any differentials or cheap bargain picks? Hopefully these tips will help you decide which players to go for in your Gameweek 1 team selection squad.\n\n0:00 Intro\n0:55 £4.0m Defenders\n11:28 £4.5m Defenders\n18:17 £5.0m Defenders\n24:03 £5.5m Defenders\n29:35 £6.0m Defenders\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦   / fplmate  \n📸   / fplmate  \n🎶   / fplmate  \n🎮   / fpl_mate  \n👾   / discord  \n🏆 Join:    / @fplmate  \n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: behupk\n\n#fpl #fantasypremierleague #premierleague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":38,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPMBEM2rARgBIhMI_9GM8vOrlgMVtY6KBx3-aC_TSMzNsLj1wqjmFcoBBFwAzMk=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVEFaZWwteklnVkliNVUxM0NsdXVqQnxBR3JiS2FuNnFnOVRwaVY2UDVRbmpyT09KVEpmdkM5VUh6UlRxcDVZZWNvTzYxYkwzSmZISHRWbXBLbEFIa3JRS3RTVF95T2FXVmQ0dVVDZkVGc2djTnc1MWd3X0JIaUNaQWpf\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Flanding%2Ffplmate%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dyoutube%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=FcyiF1cMJsw","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVEFaZWwteklnVkliNVUxM0NsdXVqQnxBR3JiS2FuNnFnOVRwaVY2UDVRbmpyT09KVEpmdkM5VUh6UlRxcDVZZWNvTzYxYkwzSmZISHRWbXBLbEFIa3JRS3RTVF95T2FXVmQ0dVVDZkVGc2djTnc1MWd3X0JIaUNaQWpf\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Flanding%2Ffplmate%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dyoutube%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=FcyiF1cMJsw","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW