ferentials or cheap bargain picks? Hopefully these tips will help you decide which players to go for in your Gameweek 1 team selection squad.\n\n0:00 Intro\n0:55 £4.0m Defenders\n11:28 £4.5m Defenders\n18:17 £5.0m Defenders\n24:03 £5.5m Defenders\n29:35 £6.0m Defenders\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦   / fplmate  \n📸   / fplmate  \n🎶   / fplmate  \n🎮   / fpl_mate  \n👾   / discord  \n🏆 Join:    / @fplmate  \n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: behupk\n\n#fpl #fantasypremierleague #premierleague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":38,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwj_0Yzy86uWAxW1jooHHf5oL9NIzM2wuPXCqOYVygEEXADMyQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUlFiZF9kX3g4UGNvaWRUMjFWT1M0MHxBR3JiS2FueDE1Y0ZyOXh2Z3ZlOEZMcE9VSzVuaS03MlVqaXdHZ21OZC1VbjV2YTlrWC01V0M3S1NMVzZ6YnRCQnpicjVVejRrSXFKUUswS0w3TUVOSzlRQXc3bmt3ZmVGUjdn\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Flanding%2Ffplmate%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dyoutube%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=FcyiF1cMJsw","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUlFiZF9kX3g4UGNvaWRUMjFWT1M0MHxBR3JiS2FueDE1Y0ZyOXh2Z3ZlOEZMcE9VSzVuaS03MlVqaXdHZ21OZC1VbjV2YTlrWC01V0M3S1NMVzZ6YnRCQnpicjVVejRrSXFKUUswS0w3TUVOSzlRQXc3bmt3ZmVGUjdn\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Flanding%2Ffplmate%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dyoutube%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=FcyiF1cMJsw","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":508,"length":4,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwj_0Yzy86uWAxW1jooHHf5oL9P